   2	 * Centralized error hierarchy for OpenVera.
   3	 *
   4	 * Every domain error extends {@link VeraError} and carries a machine-readable
   5	 * `code` string.  Callers that need to distinguish error categories can use
   6	 * `instanceof` checks or switch on `error.code`.
